      "description": "Star Anise / Bunga Lawang 100g / 250g/ 500g/1 kg\n\nProduct Name:Star Anise\nScientific name:Illicium Verum\nHarvesting Method/Quality:\nAnise is a small herb with lacy leaves. It’s a member of the parsley family. Seeds require more than 100 frost-free days to reach harvest . In late summer or early autumn, you should notice the flowers developing small green seeds .Whether you’re picking anise when it’s ripe or not, there’s no need to collect the tiny seeds one at a time .Instead, snip the stems below the flower heads. If the seeds are still green, tie the flowers together into a bundle and hang them upside down in a cool, airy place\nUses/Benefits:\n\nDisclaimer: We will ensure all the items are well-wrapped before ship out. However, there will\nbe unavoidable accidents during the transit (eg: package may be thrown or damaged). \nAny damages during the transit is not our responsibility. Please buy at your own risk.\n\nPREMIUM QUALITY : ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ \n\nAVAILABLE OUR STORE:\nOUR SHOP :\nATHI CASH & CARRY\nAddress: no 64 pekan, Hulu Yam Baharu, \n44300 Batang Kali, Selangor.",
